IS1009b 1 spk2 635.520 638.720 controller to a power supply from the electricity or
IS1009b 1 spk2 638.720 639.380 something like that
IS1009b 1 spk2 639.460 642.400 it should be a battery because a remote controller
IS1009b 1 spk2 642.400 645.300 should be like you should take it to wherever you
IS1009b 1 spk2 645.300 645.620 want
IS1009b 1 spk2 646.280 650.500 and then this integrated circuit takes energy from
IS1009b 1 spk2 650.500 652.480 the power source and whatever
IS1009b 1 spk2 652.480 655.180 like if you press a button it's like an input for
IS1009b 1 spk2 655.180 658.280 the remote controller and it takes the input and it
IS1009b 1 spk2 658.280 662.340 transforms into an infrared bits and it sends it to
IS1009b 1 spk2 662.340 665.020 the device like a tv or an air conditioner
IS1009b 1 spk2 665.180 665.800 something like that
IS1009b 1 spk2 666.020 669.220 so a remote controller is specifically designed to
