IS1009b 1 spk2 686.440 690.300 it should recognize the waves which are coming
IS1009b 1 spk2 690.300 692.620 from the remote controller and it should take the
IS1009b 1 spk2 692.620 694.720 action like if you press a button channel or
IS1009b 1 spk2 694.720 697.860 something like that then the remote controller
